// P3G.2 (external-references.md ER5.1–ER5.8, ER X2; lesson-pinning-references.png): pinning
// references, in an assembly and in a drawing. Document B "Block consumer": Assembly 1 with two
// instances of A@V1 (`linked-block consumer 2`) and "Drawing 1" with a Front view of A@V1's block
// (`linked-block drawing`).
// 01 Assembly 1: Part 1 <1> and <2>, plain version icons.
// 02 (ER5.1) right-click <2> → "Pin reference" hovered.
// 03 pinned: <2>'s icon is the thumbtack (stand-in `location`); its tooltip "Pinned: Update all
//    skips it."
// 04 (ER5.2) A gets V2: <1> shows the blue badge; <2> a grey ring round the pin (a newer version,
//    but no blue alert); the tabs Assembly 1 and Drawing 1 their badges.
// 05 (ER5.3) the toolbar's Update all references: "Block source V1 ⇒ V2" (the unpinned
//    references only: <1> and the drawing's view).
// 06 Update all: <1> at V2 (40 high); <2> still V1 (25 high), pinned.
// 07 (ER5.4) <2>'s icon clicked: the manager opens on Selective update, <2> ticked, "V1 ⇒ V2".
// 08 Update selected: <2> at V2 and still pinned (the plain thumbtack).
// 09 (ER5.7) right-click <2> → "Unpin reference" hovered.
// 10 unpinned: the plain version icon.
// 11 (ER5.6) A gets V3 (depth 55); Drawing 1, the Sheets pane: the sheet's reference "Part 1" at "V2" with
//    the blue badge, the view "Front" at "V2"; the tab badge.
// 12 right-click the reference → "Pin reference" hovered.
// 13 pinned: its thumbtack with the grey ring (V3 is newer).
// 14 (ER5.6) right-click the Drawing 1 tab → "Update linked document…" hovered.
// 15 the manager for the tab: nothing listed under Update to latest (the pinned reference is
//    skipped) → Selective update: the drawing's reference, not ticked.
// 16 ticked and Update selected: the view 55 high, "V3" in the Sheets pane, still pinned (the
//    plain thumbtack).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block"),
        Custom("linked-block consumer 2"),
        Custom("linked-block drawing"),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-two-linked-instances"),
        RightClick(ui("instance-row-2")),
        WaitFor("assembly-context-menu"),
        Hover(ui("asm-pin")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("02-pin-reference-menu"),
        Click(ui("asm-pin")),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-2-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-pinned-thumbtack"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-block edit"),
